# Xcode
#
# gitignore contributors: remember to update Global/Xcode.gitignore, Objective-C.gitignore & Swift.gitignore

## User settings
xcuserdata/

## Legacy (pre-Xcode 4) per-user project files
*.pbxuser
*.mode1v3
*.mode2v3
*.perspectivev3

## Obj-C/Swift specific
*.hmap

## Build generated
build/
DerivedData/

## Various settings
*.moved-aside
*.xcuserstate

## App packaging
*.ipa
*.dSYM.zip
*.dSYM

## macOS
.DS_Store
